//
// 79 designs (45 seating, 34 beds), each with its own model, written as one row per design. Models are authored in real metres in
// footprint space at scale 2 (fit scale 1:1), so a slot anchor is the model coordinate plus the fit offset. Seat slots: `sit`
// with the seat-top height, approach in front for lounge seating and behind for chairs and stools that tuck under a table or desk
// (see the header of objects.ts). Beds: `sleep` slots with the mattress-top height; double beds have a left and a right side.
// Finish regions come from the materials each model really uses (MATS, generated by tools/furniture-extra from the built
// models by tools/furniture-extra/gen-mats.mjs, biggest surface first), so every region names a material the model has and swatch 0 reproduces the model colour.

